Maintainer: openKylin XR SIG <xr@lists.openkylin.top>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo (>= 1.88), rustc (>= 1.88), glslang-tools, librust-xr-spatial-kit-dev (>= 0.2.5), libcairo2-dev, libpango1.0-dev, librsvg2-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: xr-shell
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libvulkan1
Recommends: xr-device-a081-controller-models, xr-environment-qingkong, xr-spatial-style-ukui (>= 0.2.4)
Description: Rust OpenXR panorama shell for UKUI XR
 Renders a versioned panoramic environment through an OpenXR Vulkan stereo
 session. A separately configured OpenXR loader and runtime are required;
 development profiles may provide an isolated loader. Installation does not
 launch XR or change the selected runtime.

Package: librust-xr-shell-protocols-dev
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: source SDK for local UKUI XR component IPC
 Versioned Rust client, bounded seqpacket metadata, immutable snapshot FD
 helpers and normative primitive types. The Shell owns this interface.
